sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant A as Hono API
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant Q as pg-boss
    participant S as Sandbox
    participant G as GitHub

    U->>A: create a card, move it into a stage
    A->>O: advanceFeature
    O->>Q: send run.execute
    Q->>O: a worker picks the run up
    O->>O: resolveAgentEnv from the organization's secrets
    O->>S: provision the card's sandbox
    O->>S: run each repository's setup command, once per sandbox
    O->>S: start the stage's agent
    S-->>A: transcript events, through the bus to SSE
    S->>S: the agent commits and writes docs/bento/stage.md
    O->>G: push the branch and open a pull request, when the stage says so
    O->>Q: send gate.evaluate
    Q->>O: evaluateFeatureGate
    alt every criterion passes
        O->>A: advance the card to the next stage
    else a criterion failed
        O->>A: hold the card, recording which one
    else the stage is manual
        O->>A: hold until a person approves
    end
